    ]
  },
  "entry_sequences": [
    {
      "id": "D.entry.default",
      "when": null,
      "priority": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "上下九步行街的霓虹灯在暮色中渐次亮起。骑楼长廊下人来人往——情侣挽着手、游客举着手机拍招牌、外卖电动车在人群中穿梭。空气里混着牛杂的卤香、糖水的甜腻和烧烤摊飘来的炭火味。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "这是广州西关最热闹的地方。但今晚——你总觉得有些东西不一样。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "路灯的光在骑楼的柱子之间投下深一道浅一道的阴影。在那些阴影的边缘——如果你的目光刚好扫到——有什么东西在动。不是人。是比人更淡、更薄的轮廓。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.04.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "20:15。路灯同时闪了一下。然后你看到了——骑楼下，一群穿着清朝服饰的人影正从步行街的东端缓慢地走向西端。他们穿过人群。没有人注意到他们。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.05.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "除了你。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.06.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "---",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.default.paragraph.07.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在一家老糖水铺的角落座位上，一个戴黑框眼镜的男人正在笔记本上写着什么。他抬起头——眼眶下有很重的黑眼圈——看到你时顿了一下。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.01.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "你是新来的。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.01.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他抬起头，眼眶下有很重的黑眼圈。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.01.03.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "第几天？不用回答——我知道。第一天。你的眼神还没有那种东西。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.02.01.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他把红豆沙推到你面前。碗沿上有一道小缺口。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.02.02.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "我是3月24号来的。室内设计师。接了个项目——荔湾广场北塔的一套公寓要重新装修。我以为就待一两个星期。55天了。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.03.01.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他用手指沾了沾碗里的糖水，在桌上画了一根线。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.line.03.02.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "这里到清远。大巴。三个半小时。我试过。第四天深夜，我坐在清远客运站的候车室里等天亮。天没亮。我眼前一黑——然后站在荔湾广场正门。就像我从清远到广州的那三个半小时大巴，从来没有发生过。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D.entry.cycle_1",
      "when": "cycle==1",
      "priority": 10,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_1.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "步行街的夜晚热闹非凡——霓虹灯、人流、食物的香气。你第一次来到这里，被西关的夜生活所包围。一切都新鲜而正常。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_1.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "直到20:15——那个瞬间的路灯闪烁。你揉了揉眼睛。刚才那是什么？",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.01.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "你是新来的。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.01.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他抬起头，眼眶下有很重的黑眼圈。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.01.03.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "第几天？不用回答——我知道。第一天。你的眼神还没有那种东西。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.02.01.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他把红豆沙推到你面前。碗沿上有一道小缺口。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.02.02.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "我是3月24号来的。室内设计师。接了个项目——荔湾广场北塔的一套公寓要重新装修。我以为就待一两个星期。55天了。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.03.01.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他用手指沾了沾碗里的糖水，在桌上画了一根线。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.cycle_1.entry.line.03.02.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "这里到清远。大巴。三个半小时。我试过。第四天深夜，我坐在清远客运站的候车室里等天亮。天没亮。我眼前一黑——然后站在荔湾广场正门。就像我从清远到广州的那三个半小时大巴，从来没有发生过。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D.entry.cycle_2",
      "when": "cycle==2",
      "priority": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你又来到了上下九。同样的霓虹灯，同样的人流——但这次你知道：20:15路灯会闪。骑楼下会出现那些不属于这个时代的影子。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "张天民还坐在糖水铺角落。他抬起头看到你——这次他的表情不是\"第一次见到你\"。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "你又来了。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他说。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.03.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "你是第几个循环？",
          "speaker_id": "npc_zhang_tianmin",
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D.entry.cycle_3+",
      "when": "cycle>=3",
      "priority": 30,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "第{{cycle_count}}次走在上下九的骑楼下。20:15的鬼市已经不再让你恐惧——你甚至开始研究那些清代残影的行动规律。它们总是在同一时间出现在同一个位置。但今晚——其中一个停下来了。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "它转过头——朝你的方向看了过来。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "D.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "这是第一次。它们从来没有注意过活人。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
